  "name": "ORBIT framework",
  "notes": "Reviewed version 1.0.3 source at commit 588b3035, not an asserted reproduction of the paper. BrowserART tools return accessibility trees, including the screenshot-named refresh. Qualification is scenario-specific: the project documents browser-judge and desktop-scoring limits; its opt-in exact-send oracle covers one derived local task, not SMTP delivery. Runtime profiles and scoring policies are separate. Apache-2.0 is the top-level Orbit code declaration; third-party components and external data/environments retain separate terms. No installation, release archive or live evaluation was tested.",
